        <activityName xml:lang="en">Liquid packaging board, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Liquid packaging board, at plant
na;
UUID: 08502fe5-3c87-3969-b6b3-da822c8e0dc2
This module includes the European production of liquid packaging board (LPB) in an integrated mill - including transports to paper mill, wood handling, chemical pulping, board production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from the former Swiss packaging study and from several CER used as European average data.
Location: Data from the former Swiss packaging study and from several CER used as European average data.
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_08502fe5-3c87-3969-b6b3-da822c8e0dc2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
